<title>UK: Reckitt extends gains in results aftermath.</title>
<headline>Reckitt extends gains in results aftermath.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Household products group Reckitt and Colman Plc saw its shares extend their strong morning gains to trade 41 pence higher at 828 in the aftermath of yesterday's results release.</p>
<p>The 11 percent rise in 1996 pre-tax profits was followed by positive comments in the press this morning and continued to fire up the shares during the day, market makers said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
